        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tom Vaughan, Dana Fox, Cameron Diaz, Ashton Kutcher, Allan Loeb, Steven Pearl\n- Products: Cold Feet, He Knew He Was Right, What Happens in Vegas, Extraordinary Measures, So Undercover\n- Roles: director, writer, actor\n- Topics: television, cinema, American comedy films\n\nFacts:\n- Tom Vaughan's television work includes Cold Feet (1999).\n- Tom Vaughan directed He Knew He Was Right for television in 2004.\n- Tom Vaughan directed the American comedy film What Happens in Vegas in 2008.\n- Dana Fox wrote What Happens in Vegas.\n- Cameron Diaz and Ashton Kutcher starred in What Happens in Vegas.\n- Tom Vaughan directed Extraordinary Measures for cinema in 2010.\n- Tom Vaughan directed the 2012 American action-comedy film So Undercover.\n- Allan Loeb and Steven Pearl wrote So Undercover.",
